In this mind map, the main topic is "Team Interaction," and it has three subtopics: "Roles," "Responsibilities," and "System Interface." Each of these subtopics has further subtopics. For example, "Roles" has two subtopics: "AI" and "Human," representing the two types of members in our team. "Responsibilities" has two subtopics: "Tasks" and "Communication," representing the two main responsibilities of our team members. Finally, "System Interface" has two subtopics: "Agency" and "Spokesperson," representing the system interface through which we interact with each other and the outside world.

I hope this mind map helps you visualize the main topic and subtopics related to team interaction!
